/-!
# Proof-carrying critical-event selection cross-compiler recurrence

The registered U8/tenure/health checkpoint is consumed intact.  The unique
runtime installs platform, executes one homogeneous relation bootstrap, and
then changes vocabulary at every generated action.  Tick `9 + 2*n` performs
the `n`th heterogeneous append and tick `10 + 2*n` answers only its generated
selection.  Every finite depth is constructed recursively; no completed
future, second runtime, sibling compiler, or old-only rechart is admitted.
-/

